# Allow-list for the repository-root build context: only backend-api and themes go in. Later lines win, so the exclusions below also apply inside them.
*
!backend-api
!themes
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
backend-api/test
backend-api/uploads
backend-api/private-uploads
backend-api/live-baseline
